        'This year marketing expects 5,000 concurrent shoppers, with bursts of three times normal traffic in the first minute of every flash sale. The platform team has already moved the database onto local NVMe drives. A consultant recommends synchronous_commit = off "for free write throughput", and a senior engineer wants to run with fsync = off during the sale window and switch it back on afterwards.',
