        'Eighteen months in, the table holds 1.4 TB. The index no longer fits in memory, insert latency climbs every week, and a nightly DELETE of rows older than 30 days leaves so much bloat that autovacuum never catches up. Operations dashboards query the last 24 hours per substation; regulators occasionally request a full year for a single meter. A new SAN with a slower, cheaper tier was approved last month.',
